            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.40

- Added YouTube's player-playlist API as an independent adjacent-artwork fallback.
- Prefetches both previous and next artwork before trackpad gestures begin.
- Preserves per-track queue relationships across rapid, repeated swipes.
- Keeps queue-store and visible-row extraction as compatibility fallbacks.
]]></description>
