            <title>2.10.39</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 14:32:25 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>57</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.39</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.39

- Replaced visible queue-row scraping with YouTube Music's underlying player queue store.
- Adjacent track previews now resolve even when Up Next rows have not been rendered onscreen.
- Added reliable title, artist, artwork, selected-index, and video-thumbnail extraction from queue data.
- Added queue-preview diagnostics and retained the DOM implementation as a compatibility fallback.
]]></description>
