        <item>
            <title>2.10.38</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 16 Jul 2026 14:25:44 -0700</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>56</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.10.38</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.38

- Corrected YouTube Music queue parsing to use its current song-title and playback-state attributes.
- Restored live next-cover previews before a forward swipe is committed.
- Separated navigation history from artwork render timing so previously loaded covers remain available several songs deep.
- Improved repeated backward and forward artwork transitions across longer listening history.
]]></description>
